WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.400
Huh? An unknown number...

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Yes?

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.250
Hello, is this the phone number 
for Sena Izumi-san?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.880
Yes, it is...

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.920
Congratulations!

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.560
Your submission was chosen for 
the Kadoyama Manga Grand Prize!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.460
R-Really?!

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.550
Yes! We'd like to begin 
serialization next week!

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.260
<b>New Series From A
 Talented Newcomer!</b>

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.220
The response has been massive!

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.560
<b>Sena Izumi Autograph Event</b>

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.560
The first volume has sold 
over ten million copies!

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:47.730
The anime has over 40% of the
 viewers in its timeslot!

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.480
<b>Angel        Heart</b>

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.480
<b>End of the Line</b>

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.480
The live-action movie adaptation is being 
shown in 140 countries around the world!

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.630
Hey, come on, everybody!

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:59.580
This is the Academy Show!

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.450
Izumi Sena!

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.750
Sena! Sena! Sena! Sena!

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.560
Sena!

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.040
Sena!

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.460
<i>Sena!</i>

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.090
Hey! Come on, Sena!

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.470
Huh? Where am I?

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:21.890
As I was saying!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:22.970
College.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.550
You were in a pretty deep sleep back there.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.970
Yeah, I've been losing 
a lot of sleep lately,

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.110
so I really crashed in there.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.800
Ah, you're trying to hit the deadline 
at the end of the month

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:06.790
for the Kadoyama Manga Prize, right?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:07.790
Huh?

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.440
<i>Kuroi-kun... how did he know?</i>

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:12.750
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.630
<b>It's done—</b>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.280
<i>...that he's waiting for 
me to finish my submission</i>

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:22.180
<i>so he can steal it and use it to
 make his own manga debut?!</i>

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:18.840
<b>Robbery                   Complete</b>

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.360
What a fearsome plan!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.590
I'm not planning anything.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.140
By the way, you just said that whole 
internal monologue out loud.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.140
<b><i>Just A Little</i></b>

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.310
Well, you've been drawing 
 in the club room,

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.320
and you mumbled something about 
it while you were asleep.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.450
I see.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.550
I wanted to keep it a secret 
until I'd actually won the prize,

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:42.400
but I guess it's out in the open now.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.720
To be honest, I'm not making much progress.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:48.620
But the special guest judge this year is 
the author of <i>Lala-Lulu</i>, Saotome-sensei!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.020
That's right, you're a fan, aren't you, Sena?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:53.330
Yep!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.580
That's why I'm determined to finish in time!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:57.710
Huh?

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.290
Oh, yeah. It beeped quite a 
few times during class, too.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.630
What? Really?

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.390
<b>27 New Messages</b>

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.390
<i>Twenty-seven new messages?!</i>

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.370
What's up with that?

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.480
Is it spam? Or is someone pranking you?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.920
No, it's someone I actually know.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.600
But he's been sending me 
heaps of texts every day!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.210
A stalker?

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:21.310
I guess he's not quite that bad, 
but he's seriously a nuisance!

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.740
Have you tried blocking him?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.950
I did try that, but...

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.480
<i>He keeps sending text after text!</i>

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.790
<i>That does it, I'm blocking him!</i>

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.000
All right! Now I can concentrate on my manga!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.710
<b>1 Hour Later</b>

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:36.970
Izumi!

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:37.710
Izumi-san!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:38.860
Izumi!

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.420
Izumi-san!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.800
You can't die!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.010
Huh?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.380
Huh?

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.730
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.280
We got this text from Ryouma-kun...

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:53.300
He said you were acting oddly, and...

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:55.600
That's seriously freaky.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.060
Right? Seriously...

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.320
<i>I had to get up at 3 A.M. this 
morning! I'm so sleepy~ </i>

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:03.530
Why does he feel the need to 
tell me his schedule every day?

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.990
<i>Having lunch now! </i>

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:09.250
<i>Our on-set lunch is my favorite, the 
katsu fillet bento lunch! </i>

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.250
Why does he have to report on 
what he's eating every day?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.330
<i>Omg, look! A vertical tea leaf!</i>

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:13.940
<i>Annoying!</i>

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.330
<b>DELETE</b>

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>So annoying!</i>

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:22.130
<i>I'm such an idiot for feeling sorry 
for him and giving him my number!</i>

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.310
Huh?

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.080
<i>Our afternoon filming suddenly got canceled!</i>

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.840
<i>Yay! I finally have some free time!</i>

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.030
<i>Which reminds me, Izumi... where are you?</i>

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.330
<i>I'm near your university right now...</i>

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:40.060
<i>Wow, your campus is so big!</i>

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.600
<i>Where are you, Izumi?</i>

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.830
<i>Never mind, I found out where you'll be!
 I'll head straight over!</i>

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:47.820
What's wrong, Sena?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.950
<i>I'm here!</i>

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.100
<i>No way!</i>

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:53.830
<i>No way!</i>

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.120
<b>Manga Research Club</b>

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.120
<i>No way!</i>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.000
Oh, Izumi!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.550
How did you get here?!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.440
Huh?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.840
By car? We were nearby anyway, so...

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:16.970
That's not what I meant!

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.440
I'm asking how you knew where I'd be!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.440
I asked Sagara-san...

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.190
<b>GRRRR</b>

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.410
<i>Rei...</i>

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.690
<b>SCHWING</b>

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.840
Play nice with the current heartthrob!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.210
He gave me super-detailed directions.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:29.610
Seriously, what a nice guy!

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:33.440
Leave now!

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:34.490
Huh?

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:37.940
Sorry, but Rei is Rei. I am me.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:38.750
No!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.710
I came all the way from Yamanashi to see you!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.680
B-But you said you were nearby anyway!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.550
Um...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:48.880
Anyway, don't come barging 
into my private life, got it?!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.380
You're being a nuisance!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.320
A nuisance?

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:56.060
Plus, if someone recognizes you 
and people start mobbing you,

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.420
it'll get in the way of our club activities.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:06:59.810
In the way...?

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.950
So hurry up and leave!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:03.560
Izumi!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.230
I...

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.260
I'm sorry!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.570
Not again!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:11.820
I'm sorry!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.030
I truly apologize!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.950
So please forgive me!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:24.170
I'm sorry!

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.360
What?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.730
H-Hey, stop already!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.880
Seriously, stop that!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.170
So basically,

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:28.430
once again, this is my extremely 
distant relative, Ryou-kun.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.670
I'm Ryou! Nice to meet ya!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.780
H-He's, um, a shut-in otaku...

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:37.640
Yep, yep!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.180
Otaku?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:44.510
But he said he wanted to see what a 
Manga Club is like at least once in his life, so...

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:45.420
Would it be okay?

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.480
Please?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.070
Well, it's fine with me 
if he's your friend, Sena.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:51.820
Yeah.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.450
Hmph! Whatever.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:54.860
All right!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.240
Then sit down somewhere, and behave.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:58.910
Yes, sir!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:00.990
Hmm...

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.900
Hey, would you switch seats with me?

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.440
Huh? I don't want to.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.990
Why should I—

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.210
Switch with me.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.240
Huh? What?

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.930
Nothing at all!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.180
Okay, then.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:29.840
<i>Pyonta</i> is going to start being serialized again?!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.210
Seriously? How long has it been on hiatus?

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.160
More importantly, when's it starting?

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.640
It would've been a masterpiece if they'd 
just let it end with the Space Arc!

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:40.920
I concur. Though, I only really 
enjoyed it through the Boxing Arc.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.120
And what were they thinking 
with that Miso Soup Arc?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.380
What are you saying? That was 
the absolute best! Sublime!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.560
What?

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.590
By the way...

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.160
When are you guys going to 
start your club activities?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.000
Huh?

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.590
I've kinda been waiting 
for you guys to start...

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.940
This is the Manga Club!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.620
Reading manga and drawing 
manga <i>are</i> our club activities!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.140
We've already started!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.060
Huh?

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.080
See, this is why I didn't want 
to bring a layman to the club.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.810
Honestly, there should be a limit to how 
completely ignorant you are about these things!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.810
So then... 

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.190
Izumi, you're drawing a manga?
 That's amazing!

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.130
Huh?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:15.650
That isn't something just anyone 
could do, right? That's awesome!

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.870
Oh... well, I wouldn't go that far...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:20.840
Can I see? Can I see?

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.940
Huh? Well, it's not published yet,

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:26.330
so I don't really want to let the story 
and characters get out there, but...

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.830
Hmm, well...

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.690
Hmm, it's really too bad... 

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:32.210
But since you want to see it 
so badly, I guess it's okay!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:33.700
Here!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:39.390
Well, it's totally not done yet, so I 
haven't finalized everything, and...

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:42.350
It's really, <i>really</i> not done yet, so...

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:48.820
<i>Is this... what they call 
modern art? Like Picasso?</i>

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:51.500
This is amazing, Izumi!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:55.190
I'm not that familiar with manga, 
but it looks totally artsy!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.280
I'm really into this sort of thing!

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:00.240
Huh?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.020
You said you're not published yet? 
It seriously looks fantastic.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.580
<b>Love is Delusional</b>

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.290
<i>Ryouma is such a great guy!</i>

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.340
Do you think I could win the prize?

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:14.590
Huh?!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.090
If I were the judge, I'd definitely give it to you!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.550
What?!

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.680
Really? You totally get it!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:22.430
Ugh...

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.320
It's my manager.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.720
I'm sorry, Izumi! They're calling me back.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.980
I've got to go.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.360
Oh, okay.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:35.070
I'll see you later.

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.100
Yeah.

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.640
Good luck with your manga!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.570
Thanks.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:44.020
<i>Ryouma... I'm sorry for thinking 
you were annoying before!</i>

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:50.040
<i>You are my manga's very first fan!</i>

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.130
All right! Let's do this!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:57.010
Kadoyama Manga Prize, here I come!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.600
Work Currently In Progress!!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.120
<b>D       O     O       M</b>

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.120
<i>I won't finish in time.</i>

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:31.860
<i>The Manga Prize has a firm 
deadline of July 31st.</i>

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:35.790
<i>Today's the 29th. Only two days left...</i>

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:40.720
Manga Prize Deadline!!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:40.720
<i>If I hand-deliver my entry 
to the publisher's office...</i>

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:45.720
<i>...and they close at 5 P.M., 
that gives me about 52 hours.</i>

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.310
<i>I've got five more pages to ink, and 
still need to do all the screentoning.</i>

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.820
<i>If inking one page takes six hours,</i>

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.830
<i>and I cut my sleep time down to three...</i>

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.440
<i>no, two hours...</i>

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.160
<i>and then give myself two 
hours to do all the erasing...</i>

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.570
<i>and color the black areas in 
two hours per page... maybe one...</i>

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.960
It's no good. There's no 
way I'll make it in time...

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.070
What do I do now?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.830
That's right! I could finish 
if I had an assistant!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.470
Sorry, I've got a part-time job.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:19.810
I'm stressing about finishing my doujinshi 
for Summer Comiket, too, you know!

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:23.050
How much are you paying? 
My time's expensive, you know!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.300
All my Manga Club friends suck!

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:32.080
<i>It's no use... My very last 
hope has disappeared...</i>

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.830
<i>I've got no choice but to 
give up on entering this time...</i>

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.510
<i>Ryouma!</i>

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.840
<i>We had a super-long shoot today, 
starting from early this morning.</i>

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.300
<i>And they still don't know 
how long it's going to go!</i>

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.950
<i>But tomorrow, I'm getting my first day 
off in forever, so I'll hang in there!</i>

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:49.830
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.660
<i>Day off...</i>

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.460
Ryouma!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.270
Sorry I'm so late!

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.270
Ryouma!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.900
They just kept on extending the shoot...

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.790
I'm the one who should apologize, 
for asking you this crazy favor.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.900
It's seriously three in the morning?

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.110
This is my room.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.570
<i>Izumi's bedroom...</i>

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:30.830
Come on in.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:32.950
Sorry for intrud—

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:33.750
<b>Everybody Watch, Lulu</b>

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:33.750
<b></b>

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.500
Sorry, this is the only spare desk I have.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.710
Wow, I guess an artist's 
room is really unique!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.420
You think so?

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.520
I'm kind of embarrassed that it's so messy.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:58.500
All right! We've got a deadline 
to hit, so let's get started!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.220
What should I do?

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:04.070
But Ryouma, you must be tired after 
filming non-stop since this morning.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.480
You can rest a little before you start.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.820
I'm totally fine!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.490
If you're working without sleep,

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.540
it's pointless for your 
assistant to be sleeping!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.540
I'm fine. If there's one thing 
I'm good for, it's stamina!

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.570
Ryouma!

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.560
So let's get started!

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.730
I really have no clue how to do this, 
so you'll have to explain everything.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.470
Okay!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.180
<i>Ryouma...</i>

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:34.060
<i>From this day forward, you aren't 
just my manga's very first fan...</i>

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.020
<b>Brother-in-Arms</b>

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:35.790
<i>You're my friend!</i>

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.990
I'd like you to color in the 
parts I marked with black marker.

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:42.070
Where?

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.070
Like here, and here.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.190
Do you get it?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.280
Y-Yeah, got it!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.920
<i>What the heck was I thinking?!</i>

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.240
<i>This is an important time for Izumi!</i>

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.830
Izumi... I accidentally 
colored outside the lines.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.470
Just use the white-out to cover it.

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:04.290
The white-out?

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:05.720
This.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:06.630
Oh, I see.

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:16.250
Izumi-san? Are you coming to breakfast?

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.730
I'll eat in my room.

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.190
If you can make onigiri or 
something, that'd be great.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.970
If you don't mind sandwiches, 
I can make those quickly.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:24.480
Sure, sandwiches, please.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.170
All right, then.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.810
Oh, can you make enough for two?

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:28.820
Sure.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.740
For two?

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.200
All right!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.040
Izumi, what next?

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.370
Already?! You're fast!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.270
I think I'm getting the hang of this.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.860
Then, can you add the screentones?

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:47.630
Screentones?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:48.730
These.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.090
Oh! The stickers with the patterns on them?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.690
First, you stick it on like this.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.520
Then you cut around the edge of the shape.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:57.310
Okay!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.060
This seems like it'll be easier than the coloring!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.560
Izumi... I accidentally cut the manuscript, too...

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.270
That's okay.

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.530
Just tape it back into place on the back side.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.570
The back side?

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.380
Oh, I see!

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:16.490
You're amazing, Izumi!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.720
You know so much about this stuff!

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:21.660
N-Not really. It's not that 
unusual to know this much.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.840
Izumi-san? I've brought your food.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.650
Coming!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.420
I'll get it!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.550
You keep working, Izumi.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:37.410
Thank you very much!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.180
Wow, these look great!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.310
Thank you for the meal!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.150
S-Sure...

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.400
A gorgeous friend?

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.640
Oh, yes!

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:52.980
He had perfect manners, and was so tall!

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:55.990
And he was as handsome as a movie star!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.740
Wow, I wouldn't have thought Izumi-san 
would have a friend like that.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.970
Just one more page to ink!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.460
Wow, good job! You should stop and eat.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.920
These sandwiches are super tasty!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.310
What's wrong?

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:16.140
I tried to draw a mysterious-looking 
stone tablet here, but...

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.930
It doesn't look very good.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:18.860
A stone tablet?

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:19.390
Yeah.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:24.730
You know, I saw a few when 
I was overseas last year...

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:26.720
Does that work?

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.100
Yeah! That's perfect!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.550
<b>RAGGED</b>

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.550
We did it!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.050
<b>RAGGED</b>

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.050
We did it!

00:17:56.480 --> 00:18:00.390
This is amazing! I never 
imagined we'd finish so fast!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.420
Now I can take my time and deliver 
it to the publisher tomorrow!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.560
I'm really glad for you!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:08.680
Ryouma...

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:10.520
Thank you for this.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.420
N-Nah, I only helped out.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:16.990
The manuscript's done because 
of all your hard work.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.460
But it was all thanks to y—

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.240
Izumi!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.660
Izumi, what's wrong? Are you okay?

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.270
Hey! Izumi!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:35.230
Yay... Manga Prize...

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.590
Oh, he's just asleep!

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:00.020
<i>This situation...</i>

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:02.960
<i>No, I can't! I can't!</i>

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.740
<i>I swore I would never do 
another awful thing to Izumi!</i>

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:13.590
<i>But...</i>

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.530
<i>Maybe just a little...</i>

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.050
Eek! Eek! Eek!

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:29.480
He didn't wake up?

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.260
<i>Then just one more...</i>

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.990
What the— Shino-san?

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:42.580
I told her I was taking the whole day off!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.260
Hello?

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:45.870
<i>Thank goodness I got through...</i>

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.040
I panicked when you weren't at home.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.150
<i>What's wrong with me 
going out on my day off?</i>

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:53.180
<i>I have stuff I need to do, too!</i>

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:54.830
The company president is asking for you.

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.190
Huh? The president?

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:57.550
<i>Yes.</i>

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:00.510
<i>I tried to tell him you were off today,</i>

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.210
<i>but he started screaming 
in my face, "Where is he?!"</i>

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.150
<i>When I told him I didn't know,</i>

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.040
<i>he yelled and cursed at me like a madman...</i>

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:08.790
<i>I'm still so scared I could throw up...</i>

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.480
H-Hold on a sec!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.800
Why is the president so mad?

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.230
Did I do something?

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.500
I don't know the details either.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.680
But he ordered me to get you and 
bring you back to his office, stat!

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:21.540
<i>What?</i>

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.630
<i>Please! If you need me to pick 
you up, I can come right now!</i>

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.820
<i>I'll take the expressway! Anything!</i>

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.910
Fine, I get it! I'll be right there, 
so wait at the office!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.790
Jeez, I guess there's no helping it...

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:40.550
<i>I should leave a note for Izumi.</i>

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:44.010
Okay!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.360
<i>This kind of chance is super rare, isn't it?</i>

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.360
<i>One more time.</i>

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:02.820
Okay!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.320
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.720
<i>Just one more time!</i>

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:12.910
Okay!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:16.960
<i>One kiss on the forehead!</i>

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:18.750
<i>And one on the cheek!</i>

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:21.480
<i>And one more on the lips!</i>

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.460
<i>This is definitely the last one!</i>

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:25.540
<i>Okay, just one more!</i>

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:29.430
<i>The next one! I swear this 
next one is the last!</i>

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:43.650
He's late!

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.930
What is Ryouma doing?!

00:23:20.970 --> 00:23:22.270
He has a friend?

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.070
What kind of relationship 
do I have with Izumi?

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:25.920
Super-fast event! Super-fast debut!

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:28.280
I'm still talking to you!

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:29.750
You're just an otaku!

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:31.880
When I said never, I meant never!

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:34.490
What Kind of Test is That?

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:35.010
<b><i>What Kind of Test is That?</i></b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>The Sena household's 
housekeeper. We owe 
her a lot!</b>
